          "id": "step-2-3",
          "claim": "Smoothness of $H_t$ makes its coordinate Hamiltonian vector field smooth. Applying [F3] on the open domain yields unique local solutions and smooth dependence wherever solutions remain in that domain. This conclusion says nothing about extension beyond that interval.",
          "step": "2.3",
          "inputs": [
