          "reason": "Statement — Constraint consistency for a regular first-order model: These conditional identities or constructions do not assert an additional biconditional beyond their stated formulation. Smooth moving constraints have independent differentials on each regular slice. Fixed-endpoint chart paths on a nondegenerate compact interval and freely varied multipliers yield tangency, with autonomous constraints removing the explicit parameter derivative.",
          "reviewed": {
