            "reason": "The Statement only asserts the moving-constraint consistency equation as a necessary condition on a stationary chart path. Its reference to thm-cm-stationarity-iff-euler-lagrange supplies the first variation equivalence used in Proof 1.1; it does not assert that the consistency equation alone implies stationary action or constraint tangency."
