        "notes": "Confirmed refuter:25:1: admissibility alone fails (χ=q, H_c=u=0, constant q=1). Added stationarity under explicit C² variations matching the exact supplier, applied to combined coordinates (q,p,u); its u equation is χ=0 and its q,p equations are Hamilton equations. Continuity includes endpoints. Differentiating χ gives consistency along the trajectory; tangency for all initial points is separately stated. Empty surfaces supply no stationary pair, r=0 recovers unconstrained dynamics, and no termination claim is made."
