          "case": "empty",
          "status": "not_applicable",
          "reason": "Statement — Massive square-root Legendre map and its future shell: The conclusion concerns supplied local or finite data rather than an aggregate construction over an empty index set. Positive mass and timelike velocity give positive square-root density, rank-three Hessian and exactly the future massive shell image. Positive-ray fibres are connected and the differential is a submersion, while the radial kernel forbids a four-velocity inverse."
